{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story and background:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Exia, a test subject of the School of Bio-Engineering of Cyan College, who gained special power through the mysterious [serum]. In order to escape from the college under lockdown and save as many survivers as possible, she must fight her way through this cruel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything comes with a price. Defeat enemies, talk to NPCs, explore areas, and finally uncover the truth of [serum] that, claimed by the scientists of Cyan College, could end pain, disease and sadness of all mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/7ba6abea2deebb3042a2fc64b7a215ac.poster.avif?t=1770023668\" width=480 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/7ba6abea2deebb3042a2fc64b7a215ac.webm?t=1770023668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/7ba6abea2deebb3042a2fc64b7a215ac.mp4?t=1770023668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hack and Slash + Souls-Like Combat:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deflect, slash, dodge, skills, use your moveset wisely to defeat various challenging foes. Build your own playstyle as you acquire more unique weapons, items and abilities along the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/56e6f9463eff7f8bd68878c5ef943a66.poster.avif?t=1770023668\" width=480 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/56e6f9463eff7f8bd68878c5ef943a66.webm?t=1770023668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/56e6f9463eff7f8bd68878c5ef943a66.mp4?t=1770023668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Non-linear world and handcrafted levels:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth the conspiracy behind the outbreak as you venture through a nonlinear world set in a biohazard background. Fight against mutated creatures and malfunctioned androids that used to protect the Cyan College. Search for the remedy that could save the infected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/0de1ea4478f6ea0d266d78bc451c2369.poster.avif?t=1770023668\" width=500 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/0de1ea4478f6ea0d266d78bc451c2369.webm?t=1770023668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/extras/0de1ea4478f6ea0d266d78bc451c2369.mp4?t=1770023668\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h5][/h5]</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794870?t=1770023668","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794870?t=1770023668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/2155b763e529e06a62e75ba18d4d7cb6534553a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770023668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794870/2155b763e529e06a62e75ba18d4d7cb6534553a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770023668","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"